[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Grok Bot
Comment=Download and install the Cursor desktop agent on first use, then launch it
Comment[zh_CN]=首次点击下载安装 Cursor 提供的 Grok Bot 桌面智能体，之后直接启动
TryExec=/usr/bin/apt-get
Exec=arlinux-popular-app grok-bot %U
Icon=/usr/share/pixmaps/arlinux-grok-bot.png
Terminal=true
Categories=Development;
StartupWMClass=grok-bot
StartupNotify=false
MimeType=x-scheme-handler/grokbot;x-scheme-handler/sand;
